# NativeWind Styling

Prefer `className` over ad-hoc `StyleSheet.create` for layout and typography.

## Design tokens

Reference shared tokens from `src/styles/tokens.ts` for colors and spacing that must stay consistent:

```tsx
// Good — token-backed semantic classes in tailwind.config.js theme.extend
<View className="flex-1 bg-background px-4">
  <Text className="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Title</Text>
</View>

// Bad — hardcoded hex in StyleSheet
<View style={{ backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', paddingHorizontal: 16 }} />
```

Support dark/light mode via NativeWind `dark:` variants and token-based theme colors.
